        "created_at": "2015-06-27T19:12:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/shadowrift/shadowrift-2nd-edition</p><p>Shadowrift is a game I've played many times with my gaming group, it's a fun cooperative deck building game. It recently had a kickstarter for an expansion and now has one for a 2nd edition of the base game. The 2nd edition will make it possible for the game to have more expansions. One big change&nbsp;is instead of the monsters killing off a specific person in town, they'll go after a certain type/class of townfolk, which opens the game up to add more. It's also getting a complete overhaul on the card design and artwork.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:44:56.044Z",
