        "created_at": "2015-06-27T23:58:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've had shadowrift for a while. &nbsp;Really fun and difficult co-op. &nbsp;When they announced the kickstarter for the expansion I jumped right on it without a second thought. &nbsp;After the way game salute has run it, I won't be backing anything else even though I'd love a second edition. &nbsp;I'll wait until retail. &nbsp;If anyone gets the chance though, I really recommend giving shadowrift a chance.</p>",
